{"seq":4,"slug":"compliance-frameworks","title":"合规框架","docCount":5,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compliance-overview","title":"合规框架概述","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/compliance-overview","wordCount":1951,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"audit-logging","title":"审计日志","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/audit-logging","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"compliance-as-code","title":"合规即代码","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/compliance-as-code","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6},{"seq":4,"slug":"security-audit","title":"安全审计与日志","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/security-audit","wordCount":1322,"readingTime":6},{"seq":5,"slug":"policy-as-code","title":"策略即代码","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/policy-as-code","wordCount":1295,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 合规框架 简介\n\n本章梳理云环境下的合规标准与审计实践，从主流合规框架到审计日志设计再到自动化合规检查，帮助读者构建可持续的合规管理能力。\n\n**合规标准概览**梳理 SOC 2、ISO 27001、GDPR、HIPAA 等主流合规标准的核心要求，分析不同行业和地区的合规需求差异与满足策略。\n\n**审计日志与合规审计**讲解审计日志的采集、存储和分析方法，介绍云平台审计服务的配置和使用，以及如何通过日志审计满足合规检查的证据要求。\n\n**策略即代码与自动化合规**介绍将合规策略编码为可执行规则的方法论，讲解 OPA、Sentinel 等策略引擎的使用，实现合规检查的持续自动化。\n\n建议读者先了解与自身业务相关的合规标准要求，再建立完善的审计日志体系，最后通过策略即代码实现合规管理的自动化。\n"}